   1:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** /**
   2:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @file    stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c
   4:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @brief   FLASH HAL module driver.
   6:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          functionalities of the internal FLASH memory:
   8:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Program operations functions
   9:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Memory Control functions 
  10:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Peripheral Errors functions
  11:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   *         
  12:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   @verbatim
  13:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### FLASH peripheral features #####
  15:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            
  17:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses 
  18:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations 
  19:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  20:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       
  21:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
  22:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        prefetch and cache lines. 
  23:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  24:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The FLASH main features are:
  25:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  26:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
  27:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Read / write protections
  28:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Prefetch on I-Code
  29:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 64 cache lines of 128 bits on I-Code
  30:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 8 cache lines of 128 bits on D-Code
  31:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       
  32:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  33:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  34:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]                             
  35:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       This driver provides functions and macros to configure and program the FLASH 
  36:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       memory of all STM32F7xx devices.
  37:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  38:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory IO Programming functions: 
  39:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and 
  40:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  41:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Program functions: byte, half word, word and double word
  42:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) There Two modes of programming :
  43:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Polling mode using HAL_FLASH_Program() function
  44:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****             (+++) Interrupt mode using HAL_FLASH_Program_IT() function
  45:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  46:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Interrupts and flags management functions : 
  47:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Handle FLASH interrupts by calling HAL_FLASH_IRQHandler()
  48:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Wait for last FLASH operation according to its status
  49:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****            (++) Get error flag status by calling HAL_SetErrorCode()          
  50:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..] 
  51:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       In addition to these functions, this driver includes a set of macros allowing
  52:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****       to handle the following operations:
  53:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Set the latency
  54:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the prefetch buffer
  55:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  56:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Reset the Instruction cache and the Data cache
  57:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Enable/Disable the FLASH interrupts
  58:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****        (+) Monitor the FLASH flags status
  59:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]	   
  60:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 	(@) For any Flash memory program operation (erase or program), the CPU clock frequency
  61:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****         (HCLK) must be at least 1MHz. 
  62:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 	(@) The contents of the Flash memory are not guaranteed if a device reset occurs during 
  63:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 	    a Flash memory operation.
  64:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     (@) Any attempt to read the Flash memory while it is being written or erased, causes the 
  65:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 	    bus to stall. Read operations are processed correctly once the program operation has 
  66:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 		completed. This means that code or data fetches cannot be performed while a write/erase 
  67:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 		operation is ongoing.
  68:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****           
  69:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   @endverbatim
  70:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  71:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @attention
