 559:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** /** @defgroup FLASH_Exported_Functions_Group3 Peripheral State and Errors functions 
 560:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****  *  @brief   Peripheral Errors functions 
 561:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****  *
 562:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** @verbatim   
 563:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****  ===============================================================================
 564:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****                 ##### Peripheral Errors functions #####
 565:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 566:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     [..]
 567:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****     This subsection permits to get in run-time Errors of the FLASH peripheral.
 568:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** 
 569:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c **** @endverbatim
 570:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @{
